From 5a2b543f50b73bbe2818e996e7284f0f93f94b48 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tara <tarathestar@proton.me>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] d/control.in: point Homepage and Vcs at qcom-linux

The milos packaging lives in qcom-linux; there is no milos-linux
repository. debian/control already says so.
---
 debian/control.in | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/debian/control.in b/debian/control.in
index 0970c58..ec9b57f 100644
--- a/debian/control.in
+++ b/debian/control.in
@@ -16,9 +16,9 @@ Build-Depends:
  bindgen:native (>= 0.65.1),
  rust-src (>= 1.78.0)
 Standards-Version: 4.7.3
-Homepage: https://salsa.debian.org/Mobian-team/devices/kernels/@KVENDOR@-linux
-Vcs-Git: https://salsa.debian.org/Mobian-team/devices/kernels/@KVENDOR@-linux.git
-Vcs-Browser: https://salsa.debian.org/Mobian-team/devices/kernels/@KVENDOR@-linux
+Homepage: https://salsa.debian.org/Mobian-team/devices/kernels/qcom-linux
+Vcs-Git: https://salsa.debian.org/Mobian-team/devices/kernels/qcom-linux.git
+Vcs-Browser: https://salsa.debian.org/Mobian-team/devices/kernels/qcom-linux
 
 Package: linux-image-@KREL@
 Architecture: arm64
